{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116185","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116185/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116185/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116185/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116185","id":3928798731,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7qLLYL","number":116185,"title":"Boot splash stretched wrong with wayland","user":{"login":"TrueJole","id":121569485,"node_id":"U_kgDOBz8AzQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121569485?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole","html_url":"https://github.com/TrueJole","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-11T21:38:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T22:28:14Z","closed_at":"2026-04-15T22:28:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced on:\n- 4.6 stable\n- master\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Fedora Linux 43 (Workstation Edition) on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon 840M Graphics (radeonsi, gfx1152, LLVM 21.1.8, DRM 3.64, 6.18.8-200.fc43.x86_64) - AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 w/ Radeon 840M (12 threads) - 13.29 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the wayland display server (prefer wayland in the editor settings), the boot splash image is streched wrong. It is correct when using the X11 display server.\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>X11 (Correct)</th>\n<th>Wayland (Wrong)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"960\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d6c425d-0393-43e7-a435-cb7c7515fdf2\" /></td>\n<td><img width=\"960\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c2359c5-48de-446a-9e01-52406a29992b\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reported window size: (3072, 1856)</td>\n<td>Reported window size: (1280, 1114)</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\nI was able to trace the bug to the `DisplayServer::get_singleton()->window_get_size()` function, which returns different values on wayland and X11 during the boot splash creation. The effect is different (but still there) when restarting the project from the editor instead of project manager and I think it might have something to do with the window animation.\n(My actual screen size is 1900x1200)\n\nFurthermore, when I created a new project but with an identical boot splash setup (just different background color), wayland stretched the image _differently wrong_ and reported an entirely new window size:\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>X11 (Correct)</th>\n<th>Wayland (Wrong)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2772b22c-ee2e-49b5-b240-7ae82d54975f\" />\n<td>\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/407e8dfb-a4b5-4117-b8b5-97879beaf101\" /></td>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reported window size: (3072, 1856)</td>\n<td>Reported window size: (1152, 648)</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\nThe reported window sizes seemed consistent for the few times I have tested them.\n\nThe boot splash setup:\nbg_color = any set color\nstretch_mode = 0 (disabled)\nimage = some set image (see below)\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"205\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85a45b3c-3737-4195-8fa5-8e5a395752ab\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set a custom boot splash image (it works with the default Godot logo too, but it's mostly just larger and the stretching is less notable).\n2. Set the `stretch_mode` to 0 / disabled (1 / keep seemed to have to effect)\n3. Set prefer wayland to true\n4. Restart the project, preferably from the project manager (as did I in my tests)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_boot_splash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25244719/mrp_boot_splash.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116185/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116185/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}